          "comment": "[Playbook] We have added an exit provision to § 3.5 so that, on expiry or termination, IBM provides up to six months of transition assistance at its then-current rates, returns our Content in a machine-readable format within 30 days, and then deletes it and certifies deletion; the Agreement is otherwise silent on getting our data back or migrating services. If six months is too long, we can accept 90 days of transition assistance with the same 30-day export and deletion certification.",
